WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:05.280
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today, I’m&nbsp;
going to explain an American science&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:10.640
fiction action film called “John Carter.” 
Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
 
&nbsp;

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:20.480
The movie starts on a strange planet called&nbsp;
Barsoom. The planet consists of three major&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:25.760
kingdoms called the Helium, the Zodanga,&nbsp;
and the Tharks. Helium and Zodanga have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:28.960
been at war for centuries. 
At the beginning of the movie,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:35.600
we see the army of Helium, in blue capes, battling&nbsp;
the army of Zodanga in red capes. The general of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:41.120
Zodanga named Sab-Than, is approached by three&nbsp;
men who claim to be messengers of God, called&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:47.200
Thern. The Thern’s leader, Matai Shang, gives him&nbsp;
a mysterious blue weapon and tells him that he has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:52.320
been chosen by the goddess to receive it. The&nbsp;
Therns have decided to help Zodanga in the war.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:57.760
They possess control over a mysterious blue light&nbsp;
called the ninth ray which makes them stronger&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.760 --> 00:01:03.120
than other living creatures on Barsoom.
The scene cuts to New York City in 1881.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:08.560
A man named Edgar is summoned by his uncle named&nbsp;
John Carter to New York City. When Edgar drops&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:13.360
at the station, he is greeted by John’s butler,&nbsp;
who takes him to John’s estate. As it turns out,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:18.640
John is a wealthy man and a former Confederate&nbsp;
army captain. John’s lawyer sadly informs Edgar&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:24.320
of John’s sudden death. John has left all of his&nbsp;
numerous wealth to Edgar. The lawyer then takes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:29.680
a surprised Edgar to John’s mausoleum, where his&nbsp;
body is being preserved. But strangely, the door&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:35.200
of the mausoleum only opens from the inside. 
Later, the lawyer hands Edgar a personal diary of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:39.120
John, which John wanted only Edgar&nbsp;
to read. When the lawyer leaves,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:43.440
he starts reading it. It begins by mentioning&nbsp;
that Edgar was the only one who believed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:48.080
John’s wild stories when he was little, so it&nbsp;
only feels right to tell this story to Edgar. 
&nbsp;

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:53.280
The story starts in Arizona after the civil war.&nbsp;
John Carter is a former captain in the Confederate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:58.720
Army, who currently looks for gold in caves.&nbsp;
Powell is a union colonel who wants John to help&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:03.440
his U.S. cavalry soldiers against the Apache.&nbsp;
So, he abducts him and tries drafting him as a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:08.720
soldier. However, John doesn’t want to fight as&nbsp;
a soldier anymore. After several failed attempts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:13.680
of running away, he manages to escape by knocking&nbsp;
a guard out and stealing the colonel’s horse. 
&nbsp;

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:18.960
The colonel and his men pursue him. Not far away,&nbsp;
they come across a mounted Apache war band. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:23.840
Colonel and the men get into a shootout with the&nbsp;
people. John tries running away amidst the chaos,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:28.560
but the Colonel gets injured in the fight. He&nbsp;
helps the colonel out of pity and brings him near&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:34.480
a cave. The cave is new to John as he has never&nbsp;
come here to search for gold. He goes inside,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:40.000
lights a match, and is beyond surprised to see&nbsp;
lots of gold embedded on the roof of the cave.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:45.440
However, just then, a man behind him appears out&nbsp;
of nowhere. The man is one of the therns we saw&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:50.640
in the beginning of the movie. The colonel alerts&nbsp;
John, who gets into a fight with the strange man.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:54.720
He shoots the man, making him fall to&nbsp;
the ground. When John goes near him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.720 --> 00:03:00.000
he hears the man say “Barsoom” while looking at a&nbsp;
strange medallion in his hands. John picks up the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:06.400
medallion and repeats the word, Barsoom. Suddenly,&nbsp;
a bright blue light flashes out of the locket. 
&nbsp;

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:11.440
When John opens his eyes again, he is in a strange&nbsp;
desert. He gets up and tries walking, but falls&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:17.120
in every step. It seems as though he can float&nbsp;
mid-air. Confused, he practices walking in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:22.640
new environment. As he walks, he reaches a hill&nbsp;
nearby where he sees several eggs hatching. 
&nbsp;

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:28.080
Just then, a large group of green creatures&nbsp;
with six limbs appear riding on massive animals.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:33.680
The leader attacks him, making John take a huge&nbsp;
leap. The rest start firing at John, but stop when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:38.800
their leader asks them to. The creature speaks in&nbsp;
a different language and introduces himself as Tas&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:44.000
Tarkas. John introduces himself as John Carter&nbsp;
from Virginia, but the creatures decipher that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:50.240
his name is Virginia. Tarkas asks John to jump&nbsp;
as he did before, but he denies and attacks him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:54.160
The creatures injure John and hold&nbsp;
him hostage. As they talk, we get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:59.040
to know that their kind is called “Tharks”. 
Elsewhere on the same planet, the princess of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:03.760
city of Helium, Dejah, practices presenting&nbsp;
a weapon she has designed to her father,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:09.200
the king of Helium. Helium is at war with another&nbsp;
city called the Zodanga and is about to lose&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:14.640
because of Therns being on Zodanga’s side. Dejah&nbsp;
has figured out the secret of the ninth ray used&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:20.160
by the Zodanga to fight the war. However, when&nbsp;
she shows her weapon to the king, a man secretly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:25.120
causes a malfunction causing it to explode. 
The king of Zodanga, Sab-Than,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:30.560
wants to marry Dejah for the war to end, but she&nbsp;
is extremely against it. If Sab-Than marries her,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.560 --> 00:04:34.560
he will be the prince of Helium and will&nbsp;
have the power to rule all of Barsoom. 
&nbsp;

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:39.760
Meanwhile, the Tharks take John to their&nbsp;
city and put him with the newly born infants.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:44.720
At night, a female Thark named Sola feeds John&nbsp;
a liquid, after which he can understand the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:49.760
language of Tharks. The following day, the Tharks&nbsp;
order John to jump high in front of everyone.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:54.480
John notices that the medallion is with&nbsp;
Tarkas and without it, he cannot go back home.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:55.040 --> 00:05:00.240
Just then, two battleships appear in the sky. The&nbsp;
Helium and the Zodanga are battling each other.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:06.400
The war is entertainment to the Tharks who bet on&nbsp;
who will win. We see princess Dejah fighting in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:12.240
the ships. She tries to control the ship but falls&nbsp;
off it in the process. John, using his newfound&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:17.520
jumping powers, saves the princess. The Tharks&nbsp;
start cheering for John who is now fighting the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:22.800
Zodanga’s soldiers along with Dejah. John manages&nbsp;
to change the course of the fight, making the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:29.040
Helium win, but their ship crashes as well. 
Dejah and John are with the Tharks. Tarkas is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:34.720
impressed by John's abilities and makes him his&nbsp;
right-hand man. John is reluctant to the idea, but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:40.800
doesn’t disagree. At night, Dejah and John talk,&nbsp;
and Dejah reveals to John that they are on Mars,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:45.760
which is called Barsoom in their language.&nbsp;
John is surprised and doesn’t believe her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:50.800
He tells her that he is from the earth. Dejah&nbsp;
too finds it hard to believe. Because of his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:55.680
thicker bone density and the planet's low gravity,&nbsp;
Carter has incredible strength and can leap high.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:56.400 --> 00:06:00.080
Dejah then takes him to the Thark’s&nbsp;
temple, where no humans are allowed to go.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:04.880
She hopes that the temple has a way to know how&nbsp;
people can travel through worlds as John did.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:05.440 --> 00:06:11.360
The kind female Thark, Sola, goes behind&nbsp;
them begging them to stop. Dejah shows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:16.080
John the statue of the goddess Issus, and&nbsp;
reads some markings engraved in it. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:21.200
the three of them are soon arrested by the Tharks&nbsp;
and sentenced to death for entering the temple.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:25.920
Tarkas asks everyone to leave him alone with the&nbsp;
prisoners in the cell in order to cut John’s hands&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:30.560
off. When they are alone, he reveals that he&nbsp;
is Sola’s father and doesn’t want them to die&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:35.840
at the hands of the Tharks. He hands John his&nbsp;
medallion and asks him to go to the river Iss&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:35.840 --> 00:06:39.600
to solve the mystery of the goddess&nbsp;
Issus and get back to his world. 
&nbsp;

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:44.000
When the Tharks look into the room after some&nbsp;
time, they see that Tarkas has betrayed them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:50.000
Tarkas’s enemy, Tal Hajus, takes charge and&nbsp;
declares himself the new leader. Then we see John,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:56.320
Dejah, and Sola heading to the river Iss. Dejah is&nbsp;
leading the way, however, Sola tells John that she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:56.320 --> 00:07:01.280
is leading them towards the city of Helium instead&nbsp;
of the river. John confronts her about it, and it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:06.480
turns out that she was taking him to her city to&nbsp;
use him as a soldier in the war. Disappointed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:11.680
John asks Sola to lead the way and leaves the&nbsp;
princess there. Dejah insists that she only did&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:16.320
it because she doesn’t want to marry Sab-Than. He&nbsp;
asks her to accompany him to the river. With no&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:21.200
other way out, she agrees. The three sail through&nbsp;
the river of Iss and reach a massive inverted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:26.560
pyramid. John and Dejah go on top of it and see&nbsp;
a strange blue energy forming on the ground.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:31.600
Dejah realizes that this is the power of the ninth&nbsp;
ray that she had made her weapon from. They also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:36.640
realize that Carter's appearance on Mars is likely&nbsp;
due to the transmission of a copy of himself from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:42.400
Earth to Mars, with the help of the ninth ray. 
Just then, an army of Warhoons approaches,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:48.320
led by Matai Shang, the leader of the Therns.&nbsp;
John bravely tells Dejah and Sola to run away&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:53.120
and fights the army of Warhoons himself.&nbsp;
The king of Helium sends his army to John's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:58.640
aid who defeats the Warhoons and saves him.&nbsp;
They take an injured John to Helium. Dejah&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:03.360
reaches her home and meets her father. She&nbsp;
is surprised to see the king of Zodanga,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.360 --> 00:08:09.200
Sab-Than, there. He has come with no weapon and&nbsp;
soldiers to ask Dejah to marry him and end the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:14.800
war. Dejah doesn’t have any other way to stop the&nbsp;
war, so she reluctantly agrees to marry him. 
&nbsp;

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:20.080
In the following scene, we see John resting in&nbsp;
a chamber in Helium palace. A soldier appointed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:25.680
by Dejah fetches him and secretly takes him to&nbsp;
her chamber. Dejah asks John to go back to his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:30.800
home using the medallion. When the guards enter&nbsp;
her chamber, John disappears. Dejah thinks that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:35.280
he went back to the earth, but John is hiding&nbsp;
actually from the soldiers. When they leave,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:40.720
he tries going outside but is soon caught by Matai&nbsp;
Shang. John is surprised by Matai Shang’s ability&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:45.040
to change into any creature around him. 
The whole city is preparing for the wedding&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:50.800
of Sab-Than and Dejah. Matai Shang binds John to&nbsp;
himself with the help of a technology developed by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:56.320
the ninth ray. John is unable to move his body to&nbsp;
his will. Matai Shang seems to be controlling him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:56.320 --> 00:09:01.680
with his wrist device. Matai Shang then reveals&nbsp;
to him that Sab-Than is planning to kill Dejah&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:06.800
and invade Helium after the marriage. The Thern&nbsp;
took his side in the war because Sab-Than was the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:06.800 --> 00:09:12.480
easiest to manipulate. But Matai Sang’s real aim&nbsp;
is to rule all of Barsoom through Sab-Than. 
&nbsp;

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:17.040
Matai Shang is about to kill John, when&nbsp;
an alien dog John had befriended earlier,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:21.680
comes to his rescue. It bites off Matai&nbsp;
Shang’s wrist device letting John free.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:27.040
He hurries to a flying craft and flies away to&nbsp;
stop Dejah from marrying Sab- Than. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:31.760
John doesn’t know how to control the aircraft and&nbsp;
crash lands near the Thark’s territory. They hold&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:37.360
him captive with a beaten Tarkas. Tal Hajus, who&nbsp;
is now the leader of the Tharks, puts John and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:42.800
Tarkas with massive beasts called the white apes.&nbsp;
John somehow manages to capture the apes in front&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:42.800 --> 00:09:48.640
of the whole Thark population. He then invites&nbsp;
Tal Hajus to fight him and defeats him in one go.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:48.640 --> 00:09:53.680
Everyone cheers for John who is now the new leader&nbsp;
of the Tharks. He then persuades them to help him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:53.680 --> 00:09:59.040
fight the Zodanga. The army of Tharks and John&nbsp;
make their way to Dejah and Sab-Than’s wedding&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:04.080
ceremony. John reaches there just in time to&nbsp;
stop the wedding. Seeing him, Sab-Than tries&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:09.440
to kill Dejah but John stops him just in time. A&nbsp;
war between the soldiers of the two cities erupts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:14.480
again. However, the Tharks are on the side of&nbsp;
Helium now. The Zodanga soon loses, but Matai&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:19.920
Shang manages to escape with John’s medallion.&nbsp;
John plans to live on Mars as Dejah’s husband&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:24.400
so he doesn’t bother to look for the medallion.&nbsp;
He and Dejah get married and the crowd cheers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:24.400 --> 00:10:29.200
for them. He is now the prince of Helium.
The following morning, John and Dejah are on a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:34.960
balcony. Dejah leaves John outside and goes into&nbsp;
the room, when Matai Shang appears. John tries to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:40.560
fight him but he manages to use the medallion to&nbsp;
send John back to earth. When John wakes up, he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:45.760
is covered in dust and his beard has grown long.&nbsp;
He is in the same cave, and looks towards Colonel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:45.760 --> 00:10:51.200
Powell to see his remains, suggesting that a long&nbsp;
time has passed in the earth while he was on Mars.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:55.200
He looks around for a medallion but&nbsp;
doesn’t find it. He has no way to go back.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:55.840 --> 00:11:00.480
The gold embedded in the cave makes him wealthy.&nbsp;
He knows that there are more medallions on earth.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:05.280
He starts a mining corporation and searches for&nbsp;
the medallion for the next ten years. Until one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:10.400
day, he finds one on a site. John is delighted&nbsp;
but he knows that the Therns have been keeping&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:15.280
an eye on him all this time. His body on the&nbsp;
earth must be protected when he goes to Mars&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:15.280 --> 00:11:20.800
because any harm on it will cause him to die on&nbsp;
both planets. That is why his mausoleum only opens&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:26.080
from the inside. He had orchestrated his death&nbsp;
to return back to Mars. John writes in the diary&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:30.400
that he wants Edgar to protect his mausoleum&nbsp;
from the Therns in turn of the wealth. 
&nbsp;

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:35.120
Edgar is in shock after reading the diary. He&nbsp;
goes out to the mausoleum and tries opening&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:40.000
it with a secret password which turns out to be&nbsp;
‘Ned’, the name John called Edgar when he was a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:45.520
kid. As the doors to the mausoleum open, a Thern&nbsp;
approaches Edgar. He had been spying on Edgar,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:45.520 --> 00:11:51.280
waiting to kill John. However, before he can&nbsp;
harm Edgar, someone from behind knocks him out.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:51.280 --> 00:11:56.720
Edgar is beyond surprised to see his uncle in&nbsp;
front of him. John takes the Thern’s medallion as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:56.720 --> 00:12:02.080
it turns out, he had never found the medallion.&nbsp;
All this, including his death, was faked to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:07.840
attract a Thern and acquire his medallion. John&nbsp;
then asks Edgar to protect his mausoleum from now&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:12.800
onwards and goes inside it. He lies on the bed&nbsp;
with the medallion and says the chantings that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:17.760
will take him back to Mars again. 
